				<li style="padding-top:0px; padding-right:0px; padding-bottom:0px; padding-left:5px !important; font-size:14px; border:0px; list-style:outside disc !important; margin-top:3px"><span style="font-size:14px"><span style="color:#525252"><span style="font-family:&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-variant-caps:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"><span style="orphans:2"><span style="text-transform:none"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="widows:2"><span style="word-spacing:0px"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="position:relative"><span style="font-size:14px !important"><span style="overflow-wrap:break-word"><span style="line-height:28px !important"><span style="font-style:normal !important"><span style="letter-spacing:0px !important"><strong><font size="4">報名簡章：<a href="https://www.emrd.tw/uploads/1/1/5/6/115637951/108%E5%B9%B4%E6%8B%9B%E7%94%9F%E7%B0%A1%E7%AB%A0.pdf" style="color:#314a58 !important; text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">簡章</a></font></strong><strong><strong><a href="https://www.emrd.tw/uploads/1/1/5/6/115637951/108%E5%B9%B4%E6%8B%9B%E7%94%9F%E7%B0%A1%E7%AB%A0.pdf" style="color:#314a58 !important; text-decoration:underline" target="_blank"><font size="4">下載</font></a></strong></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
				<li style="padding-top:0px; padding-right:0px; padding-bottom:0px; padding-left:5px !important; font-size:14px; border:0px; list-style:outside disc !important; margin-top:3px"><span style="font-size:14px"><span style="color:#525252"><span style="font-family:&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-variant-caps:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"><span style="orphans:2"><span style="text-transform:none"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="widows:2"><span style="word-spacing:0px"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="position:relative"><span style="font-size:14px !important"><span style="overflow-wrap:break-word"><span style="line-height:28px !important"><span style="font-style:normal !important"><span style="letter-spacing:0px !important"><strong><font size="4">報考資格：</font></strong><font size="3">具有學士學位(或同等學力)者至少離校<u>6年以上</u>(計算至報考當學年度註冊截止日止)，並具備工作經驗者。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
				<li style="padding-top:0px; padding-right:0px; padding-bottom:0px; padding-left:5px !important; font-size:14px; border:0px; list-style:outside disc !important; margin-top:3px"><span style="font-size:14px"><span style="color:#525252"><span style="font-family:&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-variant-caps:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"><span style="orphans:2"><span style="text-transform:none"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="widows:2"><span style="word-spacing:0px"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="position:relative"><span style="font-size:14px !important"><span style="overflow-wrap:break-word"><span style="line-height:28px !important"><span style="font-style:normal !important"><span style="letter-spacing:0px !important"><strong><font size="4">招生名額：</font></strong><font color="#2A2A2A"><font size="4">30位</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
				<li style="padding-top:0px; padding-right:0px; padding-bottom:0px; padding-left:5px !important; font-size:14px; border:0px; list-style:outside disc !important; margin-top:3px"><span style="font-size:14px"><span style="color:#525252"><span style="font-family:&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-variant-caps:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"><span style="orphans:2"><span style="text-transform:none"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="widows:2"><span style="word-spacing:0px"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="position:relative"><span style="font-size:14px !important"><span style="overflow-wrap:break-word"><span style="line-height:28px !important"><span style="font-style:normal !important"><span style="letter-spacing:0px !important"><strong><font size="4">考試科目：</font></strong><font color="#2A2A2A"><font size="3">審查（50%）口試（50%）</font></font>​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
			</ul>
			<br />
			<span style="font-size:14px"><span style="color:#525252"><span style="font-family:&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-variant-caps:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"><span style="orphans:2"><span style="text-transform:none"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="widows:2"><span style="word-spacing:0px"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="position:relative"><span style="font-size:14px !important"><span style="overflow-wrap:break-word"><span style="line-height:28px !important"><span style="font-style:normal !important"><span style="letter-spacing:0px !important"><font color="#121CB3"><font size="5"><strong>​</strong><strong>加入</strong><strong>EMRD</strong><strong>，您就是下一</strong><strong>位</strong><strong>技術長</strong><strong>!!</strong></font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>

			<div class="paragraph" style="border:0px; padding:0px; margin-bottom:24px"><span style="font-size:14px"><span style="color:#525252"><span style="font-family:&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-variant-caps:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"><span style="orphans:2"><span style="text-transform:none"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="widows:2"><span style="word-spacing:0px"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="position:relative"><span style="font-size:14px !important"><span style="overflow-wrap:break-word"><span style="line-height:28px !important"><span style="font-style:normal !important"><span style="letter-spacing:0px !important"><font size="3">EMRD學程系統化培育企業科技CTO與研發長，規劃了科技總論、專利智財、科技法律、管理與研發策略管理及科技與產業分析地圖、技術長講座、專題研究等等必修課程，並搭配設計、電子、工程與各專業領域之選修課程，每年由將近100位產、官、學、研、海內外各領域專家學者與企業資深總經理與技術長及財經媒體專家授課。</font><br />
			<font size="3">課程內容包含現今熱門產業，如物聯網、大數據、工業4.0、3D列印、智慧車輛、電池、太陽能、VR＆AR＆MR、個案研討、FINTECH、紡織、航太、創新創業等等。<br />
			​</font><br />
			<font color="#8D2424"><font size="4"><strong>​一年僅一次招生，千萬不要錯過，歡迎您的加入!</strong>&nbsp;</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>

			<div>
			<div style="width:678.73px"><span style="font-size:14px"><span style="color:#525252"><span style="font-family:&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-variant-caps:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"><span style="orphans:2"><span style="text-transform:none"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="widows:2"><span style="word-spacing:0px"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="position:relative"><span style="height:20px"><span style="overflow:hidden"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>

			<hr class="styled-hr" style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.13); border:0pt none; color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.13); height:1px; text-align:center; width:678.73px" />
